Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 03:25:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 433/488] soh: rename D_8088103C -> sTrapEnvColor

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the env colour BgHakaTrap_Draw binds
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Haka_Trap/z_bg_haka_trap.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Haka_Trap/z_bg_haka_trap.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Haka_Trap/z_bg_haka_trap.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Haka_Trap/z_bg_haka_trap.c
index bd7a3feba..e6eb1ffd3 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Haka_Trap/z_bg_haka_trap.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Haka_Trap/z_bg_haka_trap.c
@@ -528,12 +528,12 @@ void BgHakaTrap_Draw(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
         object_haka_objects_DL_007610, object_haka_objects_DL_009860, object_haka_objects_DL_007EF0,
         object_haka_objects_DL_008A20, object_haka_objects_DL_0072C0,
     };
-    static Color_RGBA8 D_8088103C = { 0, 0, 0, 0 };
+    static Color_RGBA8 sTrapEnvColor = { 0, 0, 0, 0 };  // was D_8088103C [LLM:HIGH]
     BgHakaTrap* this = (BgHakaTrap*)thisx;
     Vec3f sp2C;
 
